<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period March 10-16 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>	     March 10-16   March 11-17     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		    1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open  402,103.2  437,827.2</p>
<p> Production	     0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	 6,771.7     4,052.3     852,071.3    680,086.4</p>
<p> Home Market	321.7	 550.5	12,046.1     14,046.2</p>
<p> Stocks/close   395,009.8   433,224.4</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
